{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"Finn walks in kind of looking it over. Untouched.\n\n\"Huh well would you look at that. Some call this the safest spot in all of Empire City! I didn't believe them of course until now. I gotta say, this is a cute place!\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:30:08.781000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865706899012714496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Yeah, I thought so too.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:30:42.336000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865707039753240627","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Uh, so, I've never been on a date before, so I don't know whats supposed to happen right now.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:32:04.400000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865707383954866236","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Well usually it's a planned event. Twice a year I get my teeth cleaned at the dentist and set up a date for that too. Julie usually handles the scheduling for me though\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:32:54.567000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865707594370514944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"(XD)","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:33:09.643000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865707657602793472","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Oh. I was told that a date meant something else... I see.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:33:30.406000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865707744690569238","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Oh of course, it could be a romantic date when two people are fond of each other... oh... **OH**.. is that what you..?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:34:11.179000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865707915705188393","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Well it's worth a try!\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:34:29.944000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865707994411171890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"It finally dawns on him","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:34:44.789000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865708056674697247","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Well in this case it's a bit of just spending quality time together  getting to know one another more, and possibly going on adventure. I haven't gone out and done much of it over the past few years since the resistance was first forming. But I'm not opposed to it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:35:49.052000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865708326213517352","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"He has begun talking quite a bit faster. Semi covering his tracks.. Semi becoming self aware","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:36:08.974000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865708409771786250","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Ok, where do we start?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:36:51.262000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865708587140513823","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Well, I know of how you feel about funky magic grandmas, you told me you were raised in a cave mostly. You've already seen\" he lowers his voice \"My business with the Gazette. So I'm not sure where to start. How about this: have you ever been sailing before?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:40:20.966000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865709466703102012","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I have not been sailing before.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:40:59.357000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865709627726102538","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"But I would love to try it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:41:30.942000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865709760204242974","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"Nolan enters the cafe and goes to sit in a corner with his books and some water.","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:44:14.242000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865710445133692938","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Hmm well one day I'd love to take you on adventure and remedy that. Have you ever done wagon or chariot racing?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:44:40.266000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865710554286260255","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I have not.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:45:32.068000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865710771559465021","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"There's a lot of things I haven't done.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:45:44.868000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865710825246031912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"The more adventurous we get to be! You've flown up in flight training and been a fantastic mechanic before, so that's a pretty awesome adventure we've been on!\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:50:15.109000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865711958719463486","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Yeah, that was an intense one.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:51:39.648000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865712313302122506","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"What kind of things do you like to do in your free time?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:53:02.730000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865712661773942844","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Well, I usually just tend to my flowers in my free time. But I should probably do more stuff, now that I'm with people.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:54:16.931000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865712972994445382","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I could tell you had a green thumb from those gorgeous flowers in your hair! Things in the city could get very bogged down if it weren't for Central Park and the shrubs of Ferrytown, I'm glad you'll be on the ship to *spruce* it up!\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:55:42.306000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865713331084197890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"Evelyn giggles a bit.","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:56:23.033000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865713501905485864","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Ya like jazz?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:57:29.591000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865713781069447188","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I've never heard of it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:57:52.418000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865713876813611008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"It's a masterpiece of music! We'll have to go to a concert or I'll have Bowen and Julie play some. Ed might even be able to teach the kid some of it. Say, what is the kid's name again?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T21:59:08.413000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865714195558301727","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"It never told me. I think its a little traumatized after the attack.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:00:25.276000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865714517944959028","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"How did you meet Bowen and Julie?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:01:31.694000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865714796523552779","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Oh Bowen, Marcos, and Julie work for me! They're part of my family's business and take care of most things for me! I honestly don't know what I'd do without them. *Probably pick up some underwater basket weaving and finally learn to scuba*.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:02:52.667000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-16T22:03:02.484000Z","id":"865715136149061642","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"Finn at this point Will try and do a vibe check to see if his eccentric lifestyle is too much. (insight roll on Evelyn alright?)","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:04:28.352000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865715537480777788","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"(sure)","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:04:41.988000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865715594673782794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:04:51.482000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865715634493849610","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"Evelyn isn't trying to hide her feelings. She doesn't have a problem with Finn's lifestyle.","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:06:07.291000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865715952460365844","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I don't think I've ever really heard what you've thought about the city and the redcoats and people in it. Now that you've had some time, what are your thoughts? If you could change anything what would it be?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:07:42.466000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865716351652855818","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"When I first entered the city, I had no idea about what the redcoats were doing. Now that I've seen it firsthand, it sickens me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:09:43.089000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865716857582780476","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"And if you could make a change to the city what would it be? Actually I'll say 2 changes if the 1st change is get rid of the redcoats with the revolution\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:11:07.644000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865717212232024104","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"That would definitely be the 1st change. As for the second... I would want to find a way to cleanse the pollution in Hampstead. That fog is... terrible.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:13:57.764000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865717925766889492","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Quite indeed. I have to walk nearby it all the time, terrible to breathe in. It's the only reason I ever cover the weather on the radio\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:16:28.263000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865718557005447178","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I should clear up something you said earlier.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:18:34.543000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865719086661763073","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I wasn't raised in a cave, I just lived in one for a while.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:19:05.905000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865719218204704779","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I was born and raised in the Feywild, my father was an Eladrin elf, and my mother was a dryad.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:20:09.278000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865719484009807892","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"She wasn't originally, she used to be a fey. But then she met my father, and was punished for it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:20:54.153000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865719672230117456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"She named me Willow, and that remained my name up until I was twelve.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:21:52.739000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865719917957480508","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"My 12th birthday... that was the day the hag cursed me. I fled, no longer feeling at home in my own plane, and I stumbled through something similar to the bleeds in Ferrytown. I was trapped in the Material Plane, and the very thought of my own name saddened me, so I took the name of my father's mother.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:24:20.346000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865720537065586748","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Evelyn.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:24:29.924000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865720577238630410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"But, being around people again... it reminds me of better times.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:25:12.566000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865720756092665887","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"So, Finn. I'd like it very much if you called me Willow from now on.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:25:48.085000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865720905069756437","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I can do that. Willow. Willllloooowwww. Will-O. Wíllo. Willow.\"\nHe tries out the name a bunch getting used to it","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:26:41.097000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865721127417937940","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I like it!\" he exclaims raising a piece of roasted potato on his fork into the air","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:27:11.334000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865721254241894430","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I had something different before I chose to become Finn. Similar in a way, but moreso unique to changeling nature\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:27:56.012000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865721441634484244","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Oh, really? Do you prefer Finn?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:28:57.995000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865721701610291220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Oh absolutely. Finn is who I am primarily. I decided so. I was young when I came to this city. I had a best friend that was just a regular human.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:30:06.548000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865721989142806547","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"Nolan takes note of all the name talk, since he’s a kindred spirit. (If you have a passive perception of 10 you’d notice him starting to listen in actively)","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:30:43.017000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865722142103830538","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"(yeah my passive is 15)","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:30:57.050000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865722200963285012","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"My passive is 14\n\n\"My family wasn't always as eccentric like I am. We were a group of hard workers. My family were mostly miners, but I got a job when I came here. Everyone needed to contribute to put food on the table. I had a friend, his name was Finn and we were both the newsies on every street corner. He always had dreams to do something bigger, more robust, something that would turn people's heads.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:32:52.564000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865722685463068702","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"He notices Nolan but decides it's harmless enough that he'll just continue","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:33:14.651000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-16T22:33:24.764000Z","id":"865722778103054337","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Unfortunately, he never got that chance. He started reporting on his own to get some extra cash for his mother. It unfortunately got him in trouble with the early redcoats back then. They hurt him day in and day out whenever they caught him. But his spirit was unbreakable. I admired it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:35:01.361000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865723225677103115","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"One day though he up and dissapeared. I just didn't see him on a day we were to pick up our copies to sell. Vanished. I decided to look for him and sure enough, I found him. The king's men were.. They were brutal to him, and he remained ever so defiant. I was watching when he caught me there. It was... A rough day to say the least. \"\n\nHe falters in the memory but skips a bit ahead\n\n\"I was able to get him out with a bit of misdirection of the guards. But he was too badly hurt. I promised him that I'd make his dream come true. And that's the day I became Finn Midask.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:38:02.932000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865723987241467934","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"Evelyn has tears streaking down her face. \"What... a... beautiful... story...\" she says through tears.","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:40:46.966000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865724675249405974","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
