{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"What did you look like before, if you don't mind me asking?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:49:40.390000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865726912591953921","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Nothing important anymore. I think I shifted between kids that looked to sell the most newspapers at the time. It helped with my family before they bought a plot of land that struck them rich in gemstones and whatnot\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:54:23.232000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865728098918203403","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Before then, well, a few different personas. I don't quite remember them all. It's kind of like trying to remember everyone in your elementary school classes. At first it's really easy, but eventually it grows to be so many that you realize there's only a few core ones that remain important enough to remember. The ones that made an impact\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:56:12.832000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865728558613921792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I'm sure you always made an impact on people's lives.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T22:57:58.574000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865729002127360042","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
