{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"An elf pilot enters the cafe. \"This place seems nice, peaceful even.\" He mentions as he enters.","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:16:23.228000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866594306563244062","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"It's cute, right?\" As she finds them a place to sit. Preferably one that was just a bunch of couches and bean bags surrounding a coffee table.","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:17:27.821000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866594577485004830","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"She lets herself fall onto a bean bag and puts her feet up. \"You're not gonna ask about the face?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:17:57.116000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866594700357271564","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"It is\" The nameless answers as he sinks into a bean bag. He then props his head up on his hands and starts swaying his feet. \"I didn't want to pry, figured you'd talk about it if you wanted to. You don't have to.\" He goes silent for a while. \"Irynx is a unique name. I prefer Seraxa, but maybe just because I'm used to it.","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:19:45.115000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866595153338826753","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I can still be Seraxa if I need to be,\" she shrugs. \"To be fair, it's weird for me, too. Irinx hasn't been around for centuries. Anyone who could have remembered that name should be dead by now.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:22:39.457000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866595884581257217","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"The nameless raises an eyebrow at how Irynx was talking about herself. \"You're talking as if they're different people..\" He says with a deliberate tone.","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:23:19.655000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866596053184544788","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"In a way, they are.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:23:47.842000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866596171408736267","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"When the world closed in around me and then opened up to be so, so much more, I had to be Seraxa. Irynx couldn't survive in that world. Seraxa did it for her.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:25:47.577000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866596673614643221","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Who did I meet back in the hampstead sewers?\" The sorcer asked slowly.","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:27:40.169000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866597145859457034","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Seraxa. For as many years as I used be Irynx, Seraxa's lived that much too. You're an elf so you'd know. I was *old* when Irynx had to be tucked away.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:29:48.097000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-19T08:31:01.650000Z","id":"866597682428117013","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Not that old. Around 400 or 500, give or take a few years.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:30:03.691000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-19T08:33:39.297000Z","id":"866597747834093599","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"The nameless eyes went wide in surprise at the mention of Irynx's age. \"I'm still pretty young for an elf. Not even halfway to my second century.\" He decided not to pry any further, we all come up with our own way of handling trauma. How did he? He no longer remembers.","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:31:24.132000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866598085228757034","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"After being lost in thought, the nameless shakes their head and turns to Irynx. \"So what did happen to your antlers?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:31:46.491000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866598179009331220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Lost along with my old body. If we go to the grove now and dig it up, I'm sure we'll find it.\"\n\nShe sighs. \"Almost a thousand years and I never died once, until today.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:33:29.678000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866598611806322718","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"The nameless sorcerer grimaced at the mention of the body. \"Let's... not do that.\" He went silent for a bit once more. \"Did another deal with the ravens then?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:34:37.819000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866598897610391592","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"She nods. \"Me and another old hexblood. You'd know her as Evelyn. She's an eladrin again; her name's Willow. We talked because she wanted advice, one hexblood to another, but it ended up giving me some clarity.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:36:07.887000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-19T08:38:27.137000Z","id":"866599275381915668","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"People in this city die left and right. Keeping Irynx safe isn't the goal anymore. When this city takes me, it will be with the right name, in the right body.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:37:47.337000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866599692505710613","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"The nameless shakes his head vehemently at what Irynx says. \"Nope. I won't let the city take you. Nuh uh. We are a crew and we stick together.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:39:29.299000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866600120165466124","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
